  "measure_description": "Measured with the Powercalc Measure app (0.13.0, robot vacuum recipe) and a Shelly Plus Plug UK on the dock's mains lead, so every figure covers the whole RockDock Ultra plus robot. Four recordings: two mop runs with warm-air drying on (charges from 66 % and 43 %) and two vacuum-only runs with drying off (charges from 53 % and 25 %). Activities come from the dock's dust_emptying, mop_washing and mop_drying switches and the robot's status and battery. The charge tapers at a different battery level from run to run (about 80 % in one, 90 % in the other), and a hard run can be followed by about 15 minutes at 9.5 W before charging ramps up; neither is modelled, which is why charging validates at 2.6 W MAE. Robot label Q100TSC, dock label EWFD04HRR (UK 230 V).",
